\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Question 43 (Sturmfels). Which is more important to solve: fixing the model and increasing the number of levels in the model, or fixing binary random variables and letting the number of random variables get large? Meek: It depends on the type of problems you are interested in studying. Roehrig: You can exchange a solution to problems on binary random variables to a problem on nonbinary random variables. \href{https://aimath.org/WWN/compalgstat/compalgstat.pdf}{[S2]}
